Load nixpkgs' native EGL before the compositor restricts filesystem access.
ANGLE looks up libEGL.so.1 by SONAME, and the helper does not inherit
LD_LIBRARY_PATH from the browser.

Allow the system-managed NixOS EGL and Vulkan manifests and their driver
library directories. The driver libraries load other libraries from
those directories after the filesystem sandbox is in place.
Also allow library directories in the system graphics driver's store
closure, which can contain dependencies in separate outputs.

